TI  - Wanting sex and willing to kill: Examining demographic and cognitive characteristics of violent “involuntary celibates”
AU  - David Williams
AU  - Michael Arntfield
AU  - Kaleigh Schaal
AU  - Jolene Vincent
JO  - Behavioral Sciences & the Law
PY  - 2021
